# Research

Before specifying a feature, we research the design space: compare libraries,
evaluate trade-offs, and prototype approaches. The resulting documents are
presented here for readers who want to understand *why* a particular direction
was chosen — or who face similar decisions in their own projects.

Listed newest first; the date is the "as of" of the survey, not of the code it
describes. Older entries can have been overtaken by later decisions.

